2026-07-27T10:52:06.8590867Z i /tmp/RtmpyeH8u9/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:52:06.8591299Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:52:06.8591833Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:52:06.8592319Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:52:06.8593061Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:52:06.8594141Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:52:06.8595549Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
